# Build-context filter for docker/all-in-one/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile-name>.dockerignore). The context is the repo root, but only
# the web + bff sources are needed; everything else (databases, backups,
# node_modules, .env files, git history) stays out of the build context —
# smaller, faster, and no secrets can leak into image layers.
*

# web SPA sources (stage web-build)
!apps/web/
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/.dockerignore
apps/web/Dockerfile

# BFF sources (stage bff-deps)
!services/bff/
services/bff/.venv
services/bff/data
services/bff/tests
services/bff/.pytest_cache
services/bff/Dockerfile

# this image's own sources (s6 tree, Caddyfile template, Dockerfile)
!docker/all-in-one/
docker/all-in-one/README.md
